and that will encroach overtly on Solar themes of being the best. What remedy do you suggest?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fata-Ku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078861#post1078861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is humour only allowed one day a year?</div> </div> </div> </div>Some people would prefer we didn't have any at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":2093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","user":"Crumplepunch","date":". 04-15-2017, 09:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T06:58:12-07:00","id":1078867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fata-Ku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078861#post1078861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is humour only allowed one day a year?</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, even toward the beginning, April Fools was for plain-old mean-spiritedness. <br /> <br /> &quot;Happy New Year! Ha-ha, just kidding, go fuck yourself. Get with the times and put your celebration of the new year in the dead of winter like we did, rather than the point where everything starts growing again, ya <i>weirdos</i>.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-15-2017, 10:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T07:03:10-07:00","id":1078869,"title":"","content":"I don't remember if I was being serious or not...<br /> <br /> And now I'm trapped...<br /> <br /> Errrr...Some comment on how Sidereals would look at Solars tryig to use astrology, and say that they're welcome to it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T07:11:17-07:00","id":1078871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fata-Ku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078861#post1078861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is humour only allowed one day a year?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am pretty sure Isator meant it in good humor. A silly post deserved a snarky response =P<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Szp, I'm worried that Alchemicals might be awesome magical cyborg people and that will encroach overtly on Solar themes of being the best. What remedy do you suggest?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have a solution! When the Alchemicals book gets released, the Solars may learn the following Charm:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Actually a Robot Stance</b></span><br /> <b>Cost:</b> --; <b>Mins:</b> Stealth 5, Essence 1<br /> <b>Type:</b> Permanent<br /> <b>Keywords:</b> None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Permanent<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms</b><b>:</b> Easily Overlooked Presence Method<br /> <br /> Solars are mortal human, gifted with infinite potential. They are human at heart. But not the Solar who learns this Charm. <i>That</i> Solar is Actually a Robot. And a (super)normal human, too. Both at once.<br /> <br /> Being an Actually a Robot allows the Solar to incorporate Artifacts on their person in one way or another -- they may eat a suit of armor; shove their head through a powerbow; bite a daiklave so hard that it never lets go; et cetera. The Actually a Robot may now use the Artifact's Evocations naturally. Without the experience cost to awaken them. That would make Solars <i>weaker</i> and that is not acceptable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3365,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3365-szp","user":"szp","date":". 04-15-2017, 10:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3365-szp","name":"szp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3365_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T07:39:05-07:00","id":1078884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078869#post1078869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't remember if I was being serious or not...<br /> <br /> And now I'm trapped...</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>szp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078871#post1078871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am pretty sure Isator meant it in good humor. A silly post deserved a snarky response =P</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. Sorry for putting you on the spot Isator.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T07:50:20-07:00","id":1078888,"title":"","content":"Oh my God. I just realized the greatest threat to Solar supremacy: <i>other Solars</i>.<br /> <br /> So here's a solution:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Worst Possible Charm</b></span><br /> <b>Cost:</b> --; <b>Mins:</b> Essence 1<br /> <b>Type:</b> Permanent<br /> <b>Keywords:</b> None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Permanent<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms</b><b>:</b> None<br /> <br /> YOU ARE NOT BETTER THAN ME, EVEN IF YOU ARE. Whenever a Solar who knows this Charm interacts with another of the Solar Host, they lose access to Charms that they do not know. Which one loses the Charms? Both! None shall challenge Solar supremacy.<br /> <br /> All of the Solar Exalted learn this Charm upon their second breath.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> I think I've met my silly quota for today. Or for the rest of the year.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3365-szp","name":"szp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3365_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T11:39:27-07:00","id":1078983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078864#post1078864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some people would prefer we didn't have any at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have to admit that szp got me for a moment, if only because I've seen people seriously arguing each of these points over the years.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>szp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078888#post1078888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh my God. I just realized the greatest threat to Solar supremacy: <i>other Solars</i>.<br /> <br /> So here's a solution:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Worst Possible Charm</b></span></div> </div> </div> </div>If I may?<br /> <br /> <b>Glorious Invincible Solar Anything You Can Do I Can Do Better Infinity Plus One Prana Exercise Meditation Technique</b><br /> <br /> No one can beat the Solar Exalted, not even the Solar Exalted. Any time a Solar loses a roll, they immediately gain ten bonus successes. This can happen an infinite number of times, and has no limit to the number of times it can occur on any roll. <br /> <br /> Example: Solar Alice and Solar Bob are throwing lawn darts. Bob rolls 7 successes, while Alice rolls 26. Both Alice and Bob know GISAYCDICDBIPOPEMT; as such, Bob immediately gains ten successes on his roll, bringing his new total to 17. Since this still causes Bob to lose, he then immediately gains an additional ten successes, bringing his new total 27. Bob now wins. Because Alice now loses, she immediately gains ten successes, bringing her new total to 36, causing her to win. Because Bob now loses, he immediately gains ten successes, bringing his new total to 37.<br /> <br /> This continues until everyone else gets bored and fucks off to do something, <i>anything</i> else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Have you ever read a Coik post before, man? lol<br /> -Holden<br /> <br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/338-coik","name":"Coik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar338_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"611"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T13:13:30-07:00","id":1079019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1078813-a-solution-for-invincible-solar-supremacy?p=1078834#post1078834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Solar Astrology is like Sidereal Astrology, except there is only one college, it can do whatever you want, and you don't need any friggin' cosignatories.</div> </div> </div> </div>Solar Astrology works by utilizing the constellation of the FUCKING SUN. It even has an associated charm tree, with charms laid out to represent the constellation of the sun (ie. just one charm that does everything.)<br /> <br /> And an SMA (Solar Martial Art)! With one charm, which has the best sutra ever:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Once there as a maiden who was the best at punching people ever and she punched really really really hard until they stopped being a problem. The end.&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","user":"Aquillion","date":". 04-16-2017, 12:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T20:54:53-07:00","id":1085674,"title":"","content":"Definitely needs more work if you plan on truly encapsulating Solar Bestness. Would also like to see some community love for other splats, we still need, at the very least, a Bitterness mechanic for Dragon-Blooded and rules for the Siderial Responsibility Avoidance Prana, in dodge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12339-liberty-king-gandalf","name":"Liberty King Gandalf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T21:12:29-07:00","id":1085679,"title":"","content":"Don't forget the secret solar martial arts tree<br /> <br /> <b>PERVASIVE ROUNDHOUSE KICK TO THE FACE STYLE (AKA CHUCK NORRIS STYLE)</b><br /> <br /> <b>Inevitable Victory</b><br /> <b>Cost:</b> 5m, 1wp; <b>Mins:</b> Essence 1<br /> <b>Type:</b> Bad-ass<br /> <b>Keywords:</b> None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Until the end of the fight or which it is activated<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms</b><b>:</b> None<br /> <br /> In the first round of combat, the Solar activates this charm. Regardless of what happens throughout the course of the fight, the Solar will ultimately survive and emerge victorious. This charm makes the solar effectively invulnerable to all attacks, for though they may be beaten, bloodied, and buried under rubble or the burning remains of large tea-house, they will eventually rise to their feet to deliver a devastating blow that renders their enemy unconscious or dead. If the Solar ends the fight with a witty quip and a roundhouse kick to their opponents face, they regain essence and willpower cost of this charm.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}